        "finding": "The halt rule gives 0.0% false positives on format-free benign queries; attack-formatted benign prompts can trigger it.",
        "proposed_claim": "Logit-margin halt rules avoid false halts on plain benign queries but not on attack-formatted ones.",
        "row_ids": [
          "r14"
        ]
      },
      {
        "finding": "The logit-margin trajectory aligns with hidden-state refusal-direction projections in 10 of 12 conditions; Qwen is the exception.",
